streetCryptid Windows repeater

The repeater runtime incorporates unrealJune/trail-stash, licensed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later, pinned to 326c530149ded29c88e899c6cb2fe6a0bd0f4365.
Source: https://github.com/unrealJune/trail-stash

Local changes are distributed as native/trail-stash.patch:
- Bounded notifications when location-fix content becomes locally servable.
- Fetch state per entry, so namespaces sharing ciphertext are released independently.
- Register namespace watchers before starting live synchronization.
- Desktop repeater, content-arrival and multi-writer/multi-reader forwarding tests.

The host is built against noq 1.4.0 with one fix (MIT OR Apache-2.0), from
modules/iroh-location/rust/third_party/noq in the streetCryptid repository; its
NOTICE lists the modification.

The Windows app, Windows service, Rust host and build scripts are available at:
https://github.com/unrealJune/streetCryptid/tree/main/apps/repeater

Rajdhani and IBM Plex Mono font license notices are bundled in Assets.
The animated lattice is adapted from this project's onboarding splash design.
The icon is the streetCryptid mothman sigil (assets/images/mothman-logo.svg),
rendered by scripts/make-icons.py.
